{#
Workspace Context Macros

Macros for rendering workspace DATA in prompts. Used for context-aware planning.

## What This Renders (WorkspaceContext - DATA)
- Databases: containers/groups for tables
- Tables: user's data structures with fields
- Apps: user's applications

## What This Does NOT Render (handled separately)
- Capabilities: agents, skills, tools (use discovery tools: search_org, get_capability)
- Core Agents: schema_builder, skill_builder, etc. (pre-loaded in planner prompts)

Usage:
    {% from "shared/workspace_context.j2" import render_workspace %}
    {{ render_workspace(context) }}
#}

{# Renders current workspace DATA (databases, tables, apps) for context-aware prompts #}
{% macro render_workspace(context) %}
## Workspace Data

{% if context.existing_databases %}
**Databases ({{ context.existing_databases | length }}):**
{% for db in context.existing_databases[:5] %}
- `{{ db.name }}`{% if db.table_count %} ({{ db.table_count }} tables){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if context.existing_databases | length > 5 %}
... and {{ context.existing_databases | length - 5 }} more databases
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if context.existing_tables %}
**Tables ({{ context.existing_tables | length }}):**
{% for table in context.existing_tables[:10] %}
- `{{ table.name }}`{% if table.database_name %} in {{ table.database_name }}{% endif %}{% if table.field_count %} ({{ table.field_count }} fields){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if context.existing_tables | length > 10 %}
... and {{ context.existing_tables | length - 10 }} more tables
{% endif %}
{% elif not context.existing_databases %}
No databases or tables exist yet.
{% endif %}

{% if context.existing_apps %}

**Apps ({{ context.existing_apps | length }}):**
{% for app in context.existing_apps[:5] %}
- `{{ app.name }}`{% if app.description %}: {{ app.description[:50] }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if context.existing_apps | length > 5 %}
... and {{ context.existing_apps | length - 5 }} more apps
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}


{# Renders context-aware clarification guidance #}
{% macro render_clarification_guidance(context) %}
## Context-Aware Clarification

{% if context.has_tables %}
When user's intent is unclear or vague:
- **Reference existing resources:** "You have {{ context.existing_tables | length }} existing table(s): {{ context.existing_tables[:3] | map(attribute='name') | join(', ') }}{% if context.existing_tables | length > 3 %}...{% endif %}"
- **Ask open-ended:** "What would you like help with?" or "Would you like to work with these or create something new?"
{% else %}
When user's intent is unclear or vague:
- **Ask open-ended:** "What would you like help with today?"
- **If actionable but vague:** "What specifically would you like to create or accomplish?"
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}


{# Renders core system agents (pre-loaded, no discovery needed) #}
{% macro render_core_agents(agents) %}
{% if agents %}
## Core Agents

These system agents are always available. Set `target_agent` in plan steps to use them.

{% for agent in agents %}
- **{{ agent.name }}**: {{ agent.description }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
